99px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.8" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260426/202604260410276298_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260426/202604260410276298_720.jpg"> </div><p>今日凌晨进行的亚冠精英联赛决赛，吉达国民加时1-0战胜町田泽维亚夺得冠军。凭借这场胜利，吉达国民实现在亚冠精英联赛中的卫冕，上赛季的决赛中他们2-0战胜同样来自日本的川崎前锋夺冠。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-04-26/69ed17bef0a63native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">被指控偏袒国米！罗基：我主动暂停意大利国家裁委会负责人职务</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260425/69ecd0f9ed556.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260425/69ecd0f9ed556.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260425/69ecd0f9ed556.jpg"> </div><p>前名哨、现担任裁委会裁判指定员的罗基被检方调查，他被认定在裁判选派时偏袒国米。风波过后，罗基正式做出决定，主动停职。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-04-25/69ece198f0041native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">六台：弗里克给阿尔瓦雷斯打过电话，还有其他主帅联系过小蜘蛛</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260409/69d769d6bbb93.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; backgrou